ion 3).\n\n### Now, we know:\n- Videographer must be in position 1 (because position 2 cannot be to the left of anything else in this 2-person line).\n- The animation-watcher must be to the right of the Videographer, so animation-watcher is in position 2.\n\n### From constraint 1:\n- The Pakistani person is next to the Videographer.\n- Videographer is in position 1, so the Pakistani person must be in position 2 (next to Videographer).\n\n### Now assign:\n- Position 1:\n  - Videographer (job)\n  - Nationality: not Pakistani (since Pakistani is in position 2), so Nigerian.\n  - Movie-Genre: not animation (since animation-watcher is in position 2), so thriller.\n- Position 2:\n  - Pakistani (nationality)\n  - Movie-Genre: animation (from earlier)\n  - Job: not videographer (since Videographer is in position 1), so freelancer.\n\n### Summary of assignments:\n- Position 1:\n  - Job: videographer\n  - Movie-Genre: thriller\n  - Nationality: nigerian\n- Position 2:\n  - Job: freelancer\n  - Movie-Genre: animation\n  - Nationality: pakistani\n\n### Answer the questions:\n1. What is the job of the person who is Pakistani?\n   - The Pakistani person is in position 2, whose job is freelancer.\n\n2. What is the movie genre of the person who is Pakistani?\n   - The Pakistani person's movie genre is animation.\n\n3. What movie genre does the person in position 1 watch?\n   - The person in position 1 watches thriller.\n\n4. At what position is the person who is a videographer?\n   - The videographer is in position 1.\n\n### Final answers:\n<solution>freelancer, animation, thriller, 1</solution>\n\nFinal answer: <solution>freelancer, animation, thriller, 1</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "Let", "logprob": -0.29888519644737244}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.024908771738409996}, {"token": " analyze", "logprob": -0.5404311418533325}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.027313152328133583}, {"token": " problem", "logprob": -0.34403833746910095}, {"token": " step", "logprob": -0.007625